            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 3v13M7 12l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M4 19h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
            Download Excel
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="wp-note">
        Please note that this working paper should be used as a guide only and may be amended at any time, as it was developed for guidance purposes.
    </div>

