            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700">1</td>
                    <td>Perform analysis of the 2020 HEMIS directives on the TUT STAFF and STUDENT DATA by following the steps in the &ldquo;Analysis Steps&rdquo; section.</td>
