            <li><span class="step-num">2</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16CRSE into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">3</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16CESM into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">4</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16CRED into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">5</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16STUD into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">6</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16CREG into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">7</span><span class="step-body">Import data source H16PROF into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">8</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_QUAL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">9</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CRSE into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">10</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CESM into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">11</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CRED into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">12</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_STUD into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">13</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CREG into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">14</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_PROF into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">15</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_QUAL_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">16</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CRSE_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">17</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CESM_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">18</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CRED_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">19</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_STUD_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">20</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_CREG_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">21</span><span class="step-body">Import data source dbo_PROF_VALIDATION_DETAIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">22</span><span class="step-body">Import data source deceased.xlsx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">23</span><span class="step-body">Import data source 2024 CENSUS DATES.xlsx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">24</span><span class="step-body">Import data source Census Date list &ndash; Final Report.docx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">25</span><span class="step-body">Import data source MT-audit-prod-CRSE.xlsx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">26</span><span class="step-body">Import data source MT-audit-prod-QUAL.xlsx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">27</span><span class="step-body">Import data source MT-Audit-prod-std.xlsx into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">28</span><span class="step-body">Import data source Foundation_Sample_Moira.FIL into ACL</span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">29</span><span class="step-body">Perform data integrity checks by applying rules <strong>#1&ndash;9</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">30</span><span class="step-body">Prepare the data for analysis by applying rules <strong>#10</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">31</span><span class="step-body">Select samples by applying rules <strong>#11&ndash;22</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">32</span><span class="step-body">Reconcile the data by applying rules <strong>#23&ndash;26</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">33</span><span class="step-body">Check for Fatal Errors in the data by applying rules <strong>#27&ndash;33</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">34</span><span class="step-body">Census dates check by applying rules <strong>#34</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">35</span><span class="step-body">Course coding check by applying rules <strong>#35</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">36</span><span class="step-body">Deceased student check by applying rules <strong>#36</strong> outlined in <strong>Rules Applied (Rule Table)</strong></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-num">37</span><span class="step-body">Report on the exceptions.</span></li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Source -->
    <div class="wp-section">
        <div class="wp-section-head">Data Source</div>
        <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="wp-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width:50px">Files</th>
                    <th style="width:240px">File Name</th>
                    <th>Description</th>
                    <th style="width:180px">Note</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center">1</td><td>H16QUAL</td><td>Qualification ASCII files extracted from production.</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center">2</td><td>H16CRSE</td><td>Corse ASCII files extracted from production.</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center">3</td><td>H16CESM</td><td>CESM ASCII files extracted from production.</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center">4</td><td>H16CRED</td><td>Course Credit ASCII files extracted from production.</td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td style="text-align:center">5</td><td>H16STUD</td><td>Student ASCII files extracted from production.</td><td></td></tr>
